{
  "id": "placebo-control-group",
  "term": "placebo control group",
  "definition": "A placebo control group is a comparison group in a study that does activities intended to seem like the real training or intervention but that are not the specific skill training being tested. In this source, it involved non-task-specific balance exercises used to compare against fall-resisting skills training.",
